<description>&lt;p&gt;President Claudia Sheinbaum accused the U.S. DEA of interference after it launched an anonymous cartel tip line and Mexico filed a formal complaint with the United States. Mexican authorities opened an investigation into former prosecutor Guillermo Zuany for alleged CIA connections and possible cartel links. Mexican special forces, with U.S. drone support, captured cartel leader El Chapo Isidro, raising concerns about a violent succession battle within the organization. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE1mWXBOdnU0cFdUeGdKLW1DZlpBcURkcVRLTGFINlRKdi1LX3dMNmh1NThFVGlfNWszUlBFczBYWmpDX0RPUHl2aTM3Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNVTE3aHliRkxuTkV1MXB3TG1VVkc1TnlhWUZnZ29oX3RtRXpxY0taMGt0ZnRwX3VycGg2QW1ndWkwMEM0ZjlVYUFhcjZCcHBISEFSNmdWVkdvNnRNS1dQcF9mQ3E2TDQtbnNsQjJjTVBuOG5LY2ZkTTJZZ25GS19Jdnp5NmpablRRcFJrdm93SnZmdDFnemxiRzZfNHhMbW5WeHc3eUNzd0hVenc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPVndYQjRrcDJpX3ZNTl82RXdmSzJsWmUwMl9wdzB5MVlaTkUtTjlMQjFINjd6ZkZpNUhWelhGNk5TenV4dGVZd05SNTlpbXBQajRsb09nQ3JmZ0E2WnIxYklTS3VmclA0dVRDSGhCU2VuWGhKeHRCdW00akRyMVZLQ3V5MzFUd3ljV1M3VURnUFhmRTdzNTBBV1lwdmhMcU9WODFIc0xHR29hZ25zOXJWOXp0Mkc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQazNnUkZVd0Q0NHp4Szc1Xy16YmhLMXJJbm1NRy11R29xV0RvNEtoRkpFV2RtR0tvZ2xOeXBCYk8xTUR3amFzX0MwSjVtVFM2TUtHV2FpNWg2UDIzckZvNUdoampycG0yZFJubEd5b1NEcW5LNk9iQ1ZURVhZVnJMTkZDS2RGMDNOR1BRcWJGSDVxYjN6cTdJcG5ERV9qdTlGUDBXbDhFSHk3YlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.c